# GLOB GUARD — do not remove. The bare filenames above only match those exact
# names. After the migrations/ reorg a regenerated seed would follow the new
# date-first convention (e.g. migrations/2026-08-20_seed_vendor_masterlist.sql),
# which those patterns do NOT catch. These do, at any depth and either case.
# Committing one republishes ~2,400 real vendor names, TINs, contacts and
# addresses at pmodepartment.github.io — GitHub Pages serves this whole repo
# publicly, bypassing auth and RLS. See Known Issues #20.
SEED_vendor_*.sql
*seed_vendor_*.sql
